SUMMARY:🎬 T7 Wild Wednesday Jerry runner-runner (music)
DESCRIPTION:Status: SCHEDULED on X (seen in Poker Poster's scheduled queue)\nClip slug: v6-T7\nClip status: render NOT found on box\nPost text (as scheduled on X):\nJacks into aces. Run it twice.\n\nRun two hands the Commish a set and 86%.\n\nRunning it twice cuts variance. It doesn't promise you a split. What do the last two cards do?\nNote: Ben approved 15 Oct 12:09 via Grok Bot (with-music)
