BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:slot-20261016-1800@devonstpoker
DTSTAMP:20261015T164520Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261016T181500
SUMMARY:💬 Drama: UltimateBet 'God mode': the site where someone could see your cards (Russ Hamilton superuser scandal)
DESCRIPTION:Status: SCHEDULED on X (seen in Poker Poster's scheduled queue)\nClip slug: drama-04\nClip status: render NOT found on box\nPost text (as scheduled on X):\nFor more than four years\, someone at a major online poker site could see other players' face-down cards. The regulator named a former world champion.\n\nUltimateBet was one of the biggest poker sites of the 2000s. Like all online poker\, it ran on trust. You can't see the other players. You just have to believe nobody can see your cards either.\n\nIn early 2008\, players began complaining about accounts whose results made no sense. The Kahnawake Gaming Commission\, which licensed the site\, investigated.\n\nIts final report found that a hidden software tool had let certain accounts see opponents' cards in real time\, from June 2003 to December 2007. It identified 23 accounts using 117 usernames.\n\nThe commission said there was "clear and convincing evidence" that Russ Hamilton\, winner of the 1994 World Series of Poker Main Event\, was the main person responsible for and benefiting from the cheating. UltimateBet's owner was fined $1.5 million and ordered to refund more than $22 million to players.\n\nIn 2013\, a former employee released audio of a 2008 meeting. On it\, Hamilton can be heard saying: "I did take this money and I'm not trying to make it right\, so let's get that out of the way."\n\nHamilton was never criminally charged over the cheating. At the time\, online poker sat in a legal grey area.\n\nThe uncomfortable idea: in online poker you are not only betting against the other players. You are betting that the people who run the software are honest. Nobody at the table can see it when they aren't.\n\nHow much of your money do you trust to a system you have no way of checking?\nNote: replies on this post must never state allegations as fact\; attach Clip Lab key-moment clip if ready before slot\; Clip Lab audio clip NOT used (unofficial leaked audio of named living person)\; source-only reply
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CATEGORIES:community
END:VEVENT
