SUMMARY:🎬 T9 HCL KGao one-outer (music)
DESCRIPTION:Status: SCHEDULED on X (seen in Poker Poster's scheduled queue)\nClip slug: v6-T9\nClip status: render NOT found on box\nPost text (as scheduled on X):\nKGao jams king-queen into a trap... and walks into a second trap behind it.\n\nThen the turn gives Bear Jew a set. And Pipi already folded a king.\n\nCount the dead cards before you count the outs. How many does he have?\nNote: Ben approved 15 Oct 12:09 via Grok Bot (with-music)
