DESCRIPTION:Status: SCHEDULED on X (seen in Poker Poster's scheduled queue)\nClip slug: teach-pot-odds-basic\nClip status: render NOT found on box\nPost text (as scheduled on X):\nPot odds\, simple version:\n\nThere's $150 in the pot after their bet\, and it costs you $50 to call.\n\nYou're putting in $50 to win $200 total\, so you need to win more than 25% of the time.\n\nThat's the whole idea. Which spots still confuse you? 👇
